:: Photo High Rest
<<effects>>

<<if $photo_location is 1>>
	You sit at the base of a tree, and watch people walk by. Few enter the forest.
<<elseif $photo_location is 2>>
	You sit on a bench just outside the park. The wind sends leaves dancing across your feet, but you can't feel it beneath the costume.
<<elseif $photo_location is 3>>
	You sit just inside the shopping centre, avoiding the hustle and bustle.
<<elseif $photo_location is 4>>
	You sit outside the games shop, beside a poster of the same character that your costume depicts.
<<elseif $photo_location is 5>>
	You sit at the bus stop, beneath the shelter. Heads turn your way as the bus arrives.
<<elseif $photo_location is 6>>
	You sit on one of the benches around the statue, your costume taking up more space that most. The pigeons watch you.
<<else>>
	You sit at the top of the hill. There are more tourists here than elsewhere, and they're happy to gawk at your costume.
<</if>>
