:: Photo High Exhibitionism Sneak
<<effects>>

<<switch $photo_location>>
	<<case 6>>
		A slow-moving lorry drives by, bearing the logo of a fishing company on its side. It hugs the wall, leaving enough space for you to sidle along with it, and stay out of prying eyes.
	<<case 5>>
		You crawl beneath the low benches along the side of the square.
	<<case 4>>
		You sneak through the alleys, peeking around each corner before exposing yourself to new angles.
	<<case 3>>
		Parked cars are packed together here. You crawl beneath them, waiting for any pedestrians to pass before darting from one vehicle to the next.
	<<case 2>>
		A small, green lane runs by the street. You hurry along it. It would be pleasant, if not for the circumstances, and the fear of someone else appearing behind or ahead.
	<<default>>
		You traverse the thin alleys adjacent to the street, avoiding the hustle and bustle.
<</switch>>
<br><br>

<<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<switch $photo_location>>
		<<case 6>>
			The lorry pulls away from the road. You crawl beneath a bench before anyone sees you.
		<<case 5>>
			You reach the other side of the square, and dive down an alley without missing a beat.
		<<case 4>>
			You arrive at the games shop, near the back entrance.
		<<case 3>>
			The row of parked cars ends next to an alley, leading behind several shops. You wait for an opportune moment before emerging, and rush out of view before being seen.
		<<case 2>>
			You reach the end of the lane, and dive beneath a parked car before anyone on the High Street glances your way.
		<<default>>
			You hide behind a dumpster, waiting for a crowd of shoppers to pass.
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>

	<<skulduggeryuse>>
